---
description: Provider expansion requirements
globs: "internal/provider/**/*.go"
alwaysApply: false
---
Read docs/development/provider-guide.md before editing or adding adapters.
Keep adapter configuration explicit and advertise actual capabilities.
No imports from platform, storage, translation orchestration or HTTP server.
Map errors safely, honor cancellation and bound upstream input/output.
Add focused mock HTTP tests; never test against a paid provider by default.
